      "content": "Look, I get the ethics part, but I'm the PR Director here and I'm telling you the priority is protecting the brand. If we lead with \"misconfiguration,\" the tech blogs are going to rip us apart for being incompetent. Is there really no way to pivot the language? Even if we don't call it a \"leak,\" can we frame it as a technical anomaly during a system optimization or something that sounds more like a controlled event rather than a mistake?",
